OL,3,GNEWSASome of UK's rarest trees are
OL,4,Abeing saved by cliff-climbing
OL,5,Apensioners
OL,6,
OL,7,FSurrounded by the feral goats and Soay
OL,8,Fsheep of Cheddar Gorge are some of the
OL,9,FUK's rarest and most critically
OL,10,Fendangered trees nestled on cliff
OL,11,Fedges.
OL,13,FTo reach the 10 Faye's whitebeam trees,
OL,14,Fvolunteers of all ages have to climb up
OL,15,Fthe gorge and Burrington Combe in the
OL,16,FMendip Hills, Somerset, which are the
OL,17,Fonly places nationally the species
OL,18,Fgrow.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
