OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASome of UK's rarest trees are
OL,4,Abeing saved by cliff-climbing
OL,5,Apensioners
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey are making the steep ascent
OL,8,Falongside experts and conservationists
OL,9,Fwho are working with chiefs at
OL,10,FWestonbirt Arboretum in Gloucestershire
OL,11,Fas part of a new scheme to collect the
OL,12,Ftrees' seeds.
OL,14,FLibby Houston, an 84-year-old botanist
OL,15,Famong the people climbing cliff edges
OL,16,Fto help save the trees, said: "[If]
OL,17,Fthere's a disease around, it is a
OL,18,Fworry. They could be wiped out and that
OL,19,Fcould be the end."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
